  "title": {
   "en": "The Tomato Can"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "pl": "Kelner"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Elijah Zelenoff dreams of making it into the #1 Mixed Martial Arts promotion Pankration F.C. and becoming the world champ. The only problem is that he absolutely sucks. To others, Elijah's known as a Tomato Can--a stepping stone for up-and-coming fighters with better records. Elijah's goals seem unattainable until he's offered the chance to compete in an MMA reality show against 14 other fighters by the president of Pankration himself, Joesph \"J.J.\" Jericho. The winner will earn fame, glory, and a seven-figure contract. Does Elijah have what it takes to become the champ?"
  },
